        "id": 1308749
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-01-04T21:22:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The PINMUX entries in gpio.inc update GPIOn_GPIOn_SEL and DIOBn_CTL registers, but don\u0027t write DIOBn_SEL.\n\ngpio_set_flags() only updates GPIO registers doesn\u0027t write to any of the PINMUX registers (DIOBn_SEL, DIOBn_CTL, and GPIOn_GPIOn_SEL).\n\nAt a bare minimum the writes to DIOBn_SEL are required.  The other registers have reasonable defaults as setup by gpio.inc.  The danger is that this code is then dependent on gpio.inc doing the correct thing.\n\nThe code savings appears to be 88 bytes between the bare minimum, and explicitly setting all required PINMUX settings.",
      "parentUuid": "1ff3fadc_addac078",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 40,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 42,
        "endChar": 41
      },
      "revId": "cc72452c69b89e3b52cbea4fa1be6f9bd060033b",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
